# Public API endpoint is on purpose: it is limited to the CIDRs in api_allowed_cidrs,
# and the variable refuses 0.0.0.0/0. A private-only cluster would need a VPN or bastion.
AVD-AWS-0040

# Worker nodes need outbound internet to pull images and reach AWS APIs. This comes from the
# EKS module's default node security group. In production I'd route this through VPC endpoints.
AVD-AWS-0104
